∇ Variations(name t);ics;v
 ⍝ Every variant of paste t must give the same calendar as t itself. (Whether that
 ⍝ calendar is right is checked against the expected files, not here.)
  :Trap 0
      ics←Stable Ics t
  :Else
      (name,': variants skipped, no calendar to compare with')(⊢Check)0
      :Return
  :EndTrap
  :For v :In Variants
      (name,': variant ',v)({ics Diff Stable Ics v Vary ⍵}Check)t
  :EndFor
∇
